    {
      "page_title": "Commits, DAGs and the Three Tools",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. What a commit is",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A commit is an ==immutable snapshot object==: `tree` + `parent(s)` + author/committer + message. The **SHA** hashes all of it.",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "$ git cat-file -p HEAD",
            "tree 9f2b1c...   # the snapshot",
            "parent 4ad81e... # prior commit",
            "author  Ana <a@x> 1717...",
            "committer Ana <a@x> 1717..."
          ],
          "note": "change any line, new SHA"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Change parent or date `->` **different SHA**, always.",
            "So __no commit ever moves__ — it is copied.",
            "cherry-pick and rebase mint a {red:NEW} SHA.",
            "Author kept; committer and date are fresh."
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "ink": "black"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. History is a DAG",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flowchart",
          "spec": {
            "title": "Refs point into the graph",
            "rows": [
              [
                "a",
                "b",
                "c"
              ],
              [
                "m",
                "f"
              ],
              [
                "h"
              ]
            ],
            "nodes": {
              "a": {
                "text": "A",
                "shape": "pill"
              },
              "b": {
                "text": "B",
                "shape": "pill"
              },
              "c": {
                "text": "C",
                "shape": "pill"
              },
              "m": {
                "text": "main",
                "shape": "box",
                "ink": "green"
              },
              "f": {
                "text": "feat",
                "shape": "box",
                "ink": "orange"
              },
              "h": {
                "text": "HEAD",
                "shape": "diamond",
                "ink": "red"
              }
            },
            "edges": [
              {
                "from": "a",
                "to": "b",
                "label": "parent"
              },
              {
                "from": "b",
