            "No `-x` on a release branch — nobody can trace the upstream fix",
            "`A..B` drops **A** itself; you need `A^..B` for the range"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "git cherry-pick 9f2a1c..3de4b7",
            "# ^ 9f2a1c is NOT included",
            "git cherry-pick -x 9f2a1c^..3de4b7",
            "# ^ correct: A^ includes A"
          ],
          "note": "exclusive lower bound, always"
